# Review ownership. With "Require review from Code Owners" enabled in the
# branch ruleset for main, a change to any path below cannot merge without
# the listed owner's approval.
#
# The pipeline is listed separately on purpose: the workflows hold the
# signing identity and the registry token, and the gate scripts and
# baselines decide what counts as a pass. A change that weakens a gate
# should never ride along unnoticed in a feature PR. When the project gets
# more maintainers, these lines are where a dedicated security/platform
# team goes, instead of the catch-all owner.

